316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和西生上人山居杂咏次韵 其一","author":"李流芳","text":"一脉同澄湛，分流到各家。\n竹炉新火活，瓯面乳生花。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":31127,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和西生上人山居杂咏次韵 其二","author":"李流芳","text":"雨过才移种，风来已满林。\n庭空还汛扫，留著贮清阴。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":31128,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和西生上人山居杂咏次韵 其三","author":"李流芳","text":"到此无俗客，何妨款竹扉。\n山花能作供，林月送将归。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":31129,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和西生上人山居杂咏次韵 其四","author":"李流芳","text":"林里光初出，湖中气欲来。\n好随松影去，且放竹扉开。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":31130,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"无际游句馀将便道参云栖走笔送之","author":"李流芳","text":"六和塔前潮水浑，西兴渡头山色昏。\n归来且莫翻天竺，一路沿江到梵村。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":31131,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"为宋比玉题画 其一","author":"李流芳","text":"盘螭山外太湖明，万顷堆银五点青。\n我卜新居开小阁，松风梅雨爱君听。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":31132,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"为宋比玉题画 其二","author":"李流芳","text":"君画苍苍带雨松，我图冉冉出云峰。\n他时相忆还开看，云树平添几万重。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":31133,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"晓发邹县","author":"李流芳","text":"城边沙路净无尘，残月穿林欲趁人。\n似向江南何处见，春光晓色一时新。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":31134,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"云龙山","author":"李流芳","text":"云龙山头石皑皑，遥接孤城戏马台。\n春风一盏有何限，不见黄河天际来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":31135,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宝应道中","author":"李流芳","text":"来时杨柳尚依依，归去青青又满枝。\n可怜宝应湖中水，照见行人来去时。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":31136,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"雨中看梅西碛即事 其一","author":"李流芳","text":"记得桥边石路回，春风初发小山梅。\n柴门老树浑如昨，落日寒阴客又来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":31137,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"雨中看梅西碛即事 其二","author":"李流芳","text":"湖畔泥深屐齿稀，春萝寂寂亚山扉。\n人来犬吠梅花下，坐久经声出翠微。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":31138,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}}]